            "review_title": "Review at Brown Bean Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Maria J\nOdense, Denmark130 contributions\n0\nGreat asian food!\nMay 2015 • Couples\nMy boyfriend and I found this restaurant while staying in Da Nang. After we discovered this place, we dined here almost every night. The food is really great, fresh vegetables, lot of different flavours, very well-seasoned. I highly recommend it! Prices are from 29.000 to 69.000 VND. We usually bought three-four dishes and shared them. Our total including softdrinks was always about 150.000 VND. We really enjoyed the sauteed spinach with mushrooms, the deep fried Thailand style siumai, the noodles with vegetables, fried rice and the stewed beef with red wine sauce.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 20, 2015",
